  "body": "In https://crbug.com/995740 we have encountered a server that fails if the cors preflight options request does not have an accept header.  It seems, though, the spec does not include accept on those requests.\r\n\r\nThe default accept */* header is added in \"perform a fetch\" here:\r\n\r\nhttps://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#fetching\r\n\r\nBut cors preflight taps straight into \"HTTP-network-or-cache fetch\" further down the algorithm.\r\n\r\nIs this intentional or an oversight in the spec?",
